  "notes": "<p>This show was night four of Phish&#39;s Baker&#39;s Dozen run at Madison Square Garden and&nbsp;consisted of a jam-filled donut theme. Raspberry jam-filled donuts dipped in honey were given out to fans arriving at the venue and songs such as Sample in a Jar and Lawn Boy were jammed out longer than usual. Lawn Boy featured Page on keytar.&nbsp;My Friend My Friend did not contain the &quot;Myfe&quot; ending. Makisupa contained a Piano Man tease from Page and a Jamming quote from Trey. End of Session&nbsp;debuted at&nbsp;this show.</p>",
